        "comments": "The assembly dhCorColu1.hap1.2 is based on 49x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The scaffolds making up the following regions of the following chromosomes are of uncertain order and orientation: Chromosome 1\n29.3-34 Mbp, Chromosome 2\n14.6-17.6 Mbp, Chromosome 3\n17.5-20 Mbp, Chromosome 5\n13.8-15.8 Mbp, Chromosome 7\n11.9-14.5 Mbp, Chromosome 10\n11.3-13.9 Mbp, Chromosome 11\n9.8-11.1 Mbp.",
